            </note>
            <note corresp="#d32-f2" n="2" xml:id="d32-f2-content">
                <p>For a further report on the situation in the Republic of Korea prior to the
                    elections, see telegram 767, May 27, from Seoul, <ref target="#pg89">p.
                    89</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
